statute/terms.md:3
## Session

One conversation between a developer and a coding agent.

```yaml
agreed: agreed                   # proposed | agreed
code: [Session, SessionID]
not:
  - {name: sessions, means: the sign-in sessions table}
aliases: [agent session]
avoid: [chat]
```

Rules:
  ATTR-001 A Session without a repository is still kept
  ATTR-002 Context alone creates no contribution
  ATTR-003 Sessions expire after a day

